      "message": "What happens if the agent immediately sends an nc or lp update before handleRegisterNetworkAgent runs? Could we end up with invalid capabilities or LinkProperties (e.g., an invalid owner UID) because processCapabilitiesFromAgent and processLinkPropertiesFromAgent have never run yet?",
